### Create an order
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Alice",
  "amount": 149.90
}

###

### List all orders
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders

###

### Get order (replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

###

### Pay  (Pending -> Paid)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/pay

###

### Ship  (Paid -> Shipped)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/ship

###

### Deliver  (Shipped -> Delivered)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/deliver

###

### Cancel  (Pending -> Cancelled, Paid -> Refunded)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/cancel

###

### Refund  (Paid/Delivered -> Refunded)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/refund

###

### Transition history
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/history
